{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國人氣女團IVE成員張員瑛日前剛完成《2026 Melon Music Awards》（MMA）頒獎禮，隨即馬不停蹄旋風式襲港，驚喜現身香港迪士尼樂園擔任聖誕亮燈儀式特別嘉賓。其「人間洋娃娃」級別的夢幻造型瞬間引發全城粉絲朝聖；然而她事後在社交媒體開心分享的一輯靚相中，卻被眼尖網民捉到背景破綻，意外捲入「P圖過度」疑雲！</p><figure><img alt=\"IVE成員張員瑛。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200109293504827392130278.jpeg/NDtiBQIyXPwPf5Bao3AaX_qeLOopdh0jUXAQw1FwEMM\"/><figcaption>IVE成員張員瑛。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"品嚐拿破崙千層酥。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200112532975521792056374.jpeg/wWCim_94EUjWmUJAoICZMn-mQfs3n4nLrsZl667GZes\"/><figcaption>品嚐拿破崙千層酥。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>「人間洋娃娃」火紅短裙降臨迪士尼</p><p>張員瑛於本月16日黃昏降臨香港迪士尼，擔任《夢想成真聖誕樹亮燈禮》的特別嘉賓。當日她以一襲充滿節日氣氛的火紅露肩蝴蝶結短裙亮相，配搭優雅的招牌「公主頭」造型及閃爆珍珠鑽飾，整體打扮甜美動人。由於是次行程緊湊，大批DIVE（IVE粉絲暱稱）為一睹偶像風采，不惜一早入園逼爆美國小鎮大街霸位應援，場面極度墟冚。</p><figure><img alt=\"擔任《夢想成真聖誕樹亮燈禮》的特別嘉賓。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200112857748869120602459.jpeg/KKKS4WG2RcitYaDzgu8k6AA-5h_I4_jtof1qvKH9arw\"/><figcaption>擔任《夢想成真聖誕樹亮燈禮》的特別嘉賓。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甜美動人。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200113831766921216159728.jpeg/eJBDn6WJTab9HKehhuhG7afEa6Mtl_cI5Uar6uVGq-o\"/><figcaption>甜美動人。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批DIVE逼爆園區。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200113406456107008641752.jpeg/IX66eHEEypRTl_aW0p08P6t3CkdUI30x5_6Q7ef-kO0\"/><figcaption>大批DIVE逼爆園區。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>而在張員瑛事後於社交媒體分享的花絮照片中所見，她在樂園內外連發幾輯靚相，期間更擺出多個可愛甫士瘋狂放電，狀態極佳的她獲大批粉絲激讚「真人靚過上鏡」、「根本係公主降臨迪士尼」。</p><figure><img alt=\"狀態極佳。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200114062613024768716823.jpeg/m49Hkg5mPKvBUTI7PywP-fErMOs4JJFCStvlZErb5WQ\"/><figcaption>狀態極佳。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"獲大批粉絲激讚「真人靚過上鏡」。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200114188857380864768319.jpeg/WG4E6jUeIK9L6zg3a2Qgt2GfF9JnQ5Z19HXLO_R1yzs\"/><figcaption>獲大批粉絲激讚「真人靚過上鏡」。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><p>窗簾驚現離奇變形</p><p>不過，其中一張在室內拍攝的半身靚相卻意外成為網民焦點。有眼尖網民放大照片後發現，張員瑛身後的窗簾線條出現極不自然的扭曲與凹陷變形，隨即惹來「P圖過度」疑雲。不少網民留言嘲諷她為了追求極致比例而施展「空間扭曲術」，亦有人以「空間是為員瑛的美貌而變形」調侃一番。</p><figure><img alt=\"惹來「P圖失手」疑雲。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200114521696374784890357.jpeg/QVLRtVAs-lE4tzW9S2ZwO2gYIXvtvds90POfmNDzn5g\"/><figcaption>惹來「P圖失手」疑雲。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"遭網民嘲：「空間扭曲術」。（IG@for_everyoung10）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200117456249556992652913.jpeg/VtEFd1s2hzQr35KE4jHBBjvgbG5YTs53p9Y8NKfWPDQ\"/><figcaption>遭網民嘲：「空間扭曲術」。（IG@for_everyoung10）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:38:00.219617+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":848,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:15:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:52.217439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:31:22.251437+00:00","content_hash":"bb1b8ee67085690dbd676e62486e02f7da7541a1f24792cbc69b3e76bcdcce3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}